## Design system

TailAdmin — free Tailwind CSS dashboard template, v2.3.0.
<https://tailadmin.com> · <https://github.com/TailAdmin/tailadmin-free-tailwind-dashboard-template>
Copyright (c) 2023 TailAdmin. Licensed under the MIT License; note that the
template's own `package.json` declares ISC, while its LICENSE file is MIT.
adminata transcribes markup recipes and design tokens from the free edition. It
does not vendor the template, and it does not use the TailAdmin name or logo as
its own branding. Templates derived from a TailAdmin partial carry a Twig
comment naming the source.

