## Not bundled

jQuery, jQuery UI, jquery-form, select2, iCheck, x-editable, Bootstrap,
AdminLTE, Tempus Dominus and slimscroll — all present in upstream Sonata Admin
— are **not** part of adminata and are not dependencies of it.
